    "Digital Consulting and Analytics",
    "We develop digital and marketing strategies that keep you competitive in the dynamic digital world. We are happy not only to deliver tailored strategies for success for your digital transformation, but also to support you as a digital partner in putting them into practice.",
    "Whether it's a new e-commerce platform, data-driven marketing or change management: In Digital Business Consulting, we work together to develop a strategic direction that identifies trends and opportunities. Benefit from our digital expertise with goals tailored to your needs.",
    "Our Technology Consulting analyzes your current system landscape, advises on modern technologies and supports you in building a profitable, sustainable IT architecture. Get IT strategies and accompanying solutions directly from a single source.",
    "Our specialists provide comprehensive advice on data analytics and intelligence. Consolidate, evaluate and finally understand: Get the most out of your data. We also support you in the selection and development of suitable business intelligence solutions.",
    "Our experts in user experience design create digital products and services that people like to use and that offer real added value. From analysis to agile conception to testing: We accompany and advise you throughout the entire UX/UI implementation.",
    "In today's digital landscape, organisations are increasingly exposed to cyber-attacks such as phishing, ransomware and SPAM bots. Increasing digitalisation through cloud migration, AI and blockchain, as well as stricter compliance requirements, are increasing the attack surface. Our cybersecurity audits and solutions protect your digital applications, identify risks early and minimise them effectively - without compromising productivity.",
